ant allies she has of course this  raises the question of who's actually in  charge and pulling the strings behind  the scenes in addition there's a honda  warrior that we definitely need to keep  in mind for a possible second part  zapin has had the most sacred thing for  him ruined by elita namely his face he's  surely out for revenge while stop at  nothing to get it the fact that he's  unscrupulous was already shown by the  man in which he used hugo to make alita  a target ultimately stabbing him to  death it is conceivable that he will  join forces with a powerful enemy from  xalam as they attempt to hunt her down  and the manga one character appears  which we would particularly like to see  in the second part chaos who has  psychometric abilities he can learn  everything about his counterparts passed  by a mere touch and the manga he thus  becomes an important person when it  comes to working out alita's warlike  backstory he's also the one who detects  and terminates this special dependency  between xalum and elita something that  surely some fans can also envision is a  prequel that mainly deals with elite's  early life the manga series battle age  lolita mars chronicle is about exactly  this period though not only about the  great war of that time but also about  live on mars and earth and the troubles  between the two planets we notice that  there's definitely enough material if  robert rodriguez and james cameron are  going to make another movie we can  assume that they will mostly be inspired  by the original manga and battle angel  alida last order the storylines differed  too much from what was aimed for in the  first film after all because even though  the director stated in an interview that  he considers the film and the story to  be a concluded story arc there is still  a lot to be told in our opinion  well enough of the big talk let's get to  the most important thing what are the  prospects for a second part here two  opinions differ we will focus 